WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:35.870
Soon after the trip of learning cuisine,

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.660
I'm in charge

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.400
of the kitchen

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:40.430
when Chef Ruoh and Chef Zhou Yu

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.200
are absent.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.000
Me?

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.500
Yes, you, Mao.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.280
However,

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.270
an unexpected guest came to our restaurant.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.960
Will you take my challenge, kid?

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.950
No, Super Chef.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.230
Flying Ace Targeted Mao

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:15.950
Without any reason

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.310
or bet,

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:18.720
I just want to have a competition in shumai

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.100
with you.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:22.050
Competition in shumai?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:22.910
Mao.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.530
Are you OK with it,

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.040
Super Chef?

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.410
Conpetition in shumai?

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.950
I can't sleep

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.130
if I leave

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.160
just after

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.480
tasting your shumai from three different kinds of eggs.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.930
Chicken eggs,

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.630
century eggs which are also duck eggs

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.600
and the Shanghai crab eggs active in my mouth

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.560
are a perfect match

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.960
of three eggs.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:55.350
But,

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.610
I believe you can

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.970
do more than that.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:00.260
Show

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:01.360
me

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:08.950
all

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.160
your knacks.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.360
That is...

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.590
Well, I won't go easy on you.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.530
What a black steel bar!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.420
It's time for me to take it out.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.430
You won't beat it.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.260
These marks are...

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.100
Do they

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.480
represent the number of people defeated by him?

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.760
To some extent, it's my resume.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.330
Once I defeat a first-class cook,

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.380
I'll carve a star mark

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.860
on it.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.340
A star mark?

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.800
Master Zhao from Senior Care Garden in Shanxi Province,

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.020
Master Zhou from Yuexia Restaurant in Beijing Province,

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.510
Deng Fang from Spring Dawn Restaurant
in Yunnan Province and so on.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.700
They all have reputations

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.460
shine like stars.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.090
You defeat those first-class cooks
whose reputations shine like stars

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:32.690
one by one.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.810
That’s why it's call star mark.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.610
How fierce these battles are?

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.360
What kind of shumai

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.030
can this man of steel bar make?

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.540
How can it

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:46.630
beat so many masters

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.070
one after another.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.410
I really want to compete with him.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.790
You're also a first-class cook

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.740
honored as the Super Chef.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:58.770
You must be interested

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:00.380
in my challenge, right?

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:03.630
But...

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.960
The kitchen is in your charge.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.060
You are in charge of Yang Spring Restaurant now.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.560
I'm the man in charge here.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.260
If I take challenges casually,

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:16.830
the whole restaurant may be in trouble.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.490
But I really want to know

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:20.570
what kind of shumai he can make

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.720
with this steel bar.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.410
All right.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.160
No, you can't take it.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:31.780
Meili.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.540
If you take it,

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.510
you may be punished.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.270
Yes, Mao.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.400
You also say that

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.660
rules in Yang Spring Restaurant are very strict.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.420
Kids, what are you saying?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.810
Put the rules aside.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.830
Can't you follow the honest thought in your mind

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.840
as a cook?

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.420
The honest thought?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:53.850
No.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.450
Don't take it, please.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.470
Mao!

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.060
If you really have the spirit of a cook,

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.920
you'll say yes, won't you?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.380
That's very nice of you.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:08.200
But I can't take it.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.270
Why?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.810
I can't take it now.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.520
I'm wrong about you.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.110
You're such a coward.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.750
Screw the Super Chef.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:22.930
Crew Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.900
Screw the rules.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.110
He's going crazy.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.360
If I don’t do this,

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.030
I can't calm down.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.660
Yang Spring Restaurant will be destroyed.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.830
The power of this steel bar is astonishing.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.780
How does he use the steel bar?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.810
What kind of shumai can he make?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.850
What?

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:03.410
I really want to know

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.620
how he uses the steel bar

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.060
to make shumai.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.230
I really want to know as a cook.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:12.370
So I'm sorry,

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.780
Chef Ruoh, Chef Zhou Yu and Meili.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:18.050
I accept your challenge.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.410
You finally make up your mind, right?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:34.170
Mao, don't accept it.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:34.990
Mao.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:36.510
I'll take the responsibility for this.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:37.960
What?

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:40.270
You should think twice.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.030
Do you wanna be driven out of our restaurant?

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:42.960
Mao.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.500
You can't stop him, Meili.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.120
Chef Ruoh! Chef Zhou Yu!

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:52.470
Father.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.430
It's good for you to learn more
when you are still young.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:58.310
Mao,

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.220
the key is in your hand, right?

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.360
Yes, Chef Zhou Yu.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.320
I give it to you

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.430
not to

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.850
hope that you can guard Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.030
We give it to you

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.820
because we believe

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:12.330
you have the courage

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.150
of a cook.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:15.640
Yes.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.340
If you think you should take this challenge,

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.670
why do you hesitate?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.260
Even if you lose the competition,

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:23.940
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.750
will still be proud of your spirit as a cook.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:27.940
We won't feel ashamed.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:28.900
Yes.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:31.460
He's right.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.860
What?

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.430
We worried too much.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.400
You are

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.390
the famous Chef Ruoh and Chef Zhou Yu.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.340
I'm really surprised.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.430
This restaurant is like a surprise box.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.350
I won't know who I may meet here.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.210
But why would you

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.140
make a mess here?

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.130
This pot is one of my treasures.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.350
It should look like this.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.790
Running around with this troublesome staff,

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.450
you're Chef Xie, right?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.010
He's Xie Lu.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.900
Do you know him, old man?

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.090
He's born in Shanxi Province which is home to dim sum.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.080
He's a talent in dim sum

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.220
and the Dim Sum Master

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.260
who walks around the country to learn new skills.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.630
People all call him Steel Bar Xie.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:27.840
Am I right?

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.650
Dim Sum Master!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.490
Dim Sum Master.

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:35.750
Mao

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.040
is the youngest Super Chef in history.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.030
And you're the youngest man

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:39.800
who wins the title of Dim Sum Master

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.340
which is the greatest honor

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.770
for pastry cooks.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.650
Amazing.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.850
This restaurant is starting to grow on me.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.060
He's

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.300
so rude!

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.510
I suppose

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.950
you can be the judge, Chef Ruoh.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:06.800
If I'm the judge,

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:08.560
I may make a decision

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:10.540
in Mao's favor.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.630
I believe you'll choose me.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:15.840
He should be so confident.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.380
Did you hear that, Mao?

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.190
I won't lose to you.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:31.730
Come on.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.850
The time limit is two hours.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.770
(Mercury from High Above)
You can use any ingredient or facility

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:42.770
(Mercury from High Above)
in the kitchen

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.130
(Mercury from High Above)
as you want.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.810
There's one more rule.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:50.880
You need to make shumai for fifty people.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.310
Fifty people?

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.660
That's too much.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.300
The taste will be judged by

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.980
Chef Ruoh.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:59.160
Do you agree?

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.110
Yes.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.040
It's okay.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:02.390
Well...

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:05.620
Start!

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.000
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.600
We should make shumai for fifty people.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.150
The old man's request

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.600
is quite unbelievable.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:31.090
Well, my hands are aching.

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:32.250
Don't worry.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:33.100
Mao did a lot

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:33.960
when competing with

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:37.570
the Dumpling Brothers.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:38.950
On second thought,

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.090
dumpling wrapper and shumai wrapper

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.470
are almost the same.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.180
You're wrong.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.650
The wrapper is the biggest difference

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.880
between dumpling and shumai.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:50.260
But aren't they

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.820
both made from flour?

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:52.540
Silang,

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.570
you've been studying cuisine for three years, right?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.320
Sort of.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:56.390
Listen carefully.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.190
The difference is that

00:11:58.840 --> 00:11:59.800
dumpling wrapper

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.890
must lock the flavour of fillings inside.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.480
It's just like a bag.

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.750
But shumai wrapper

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.820
must cover fillings' flavour lightly

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.810
as a silk cloak.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.740
So shumai wrapper

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.090
must be thinner and softer

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.830
than dumpling wrapper.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.950
I see.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.040
Only skillful cooks

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.080
can make so many elaborate wrappers.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:23.700
You know it well.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.960
He's really strange.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.380
I have never seen such a technique.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:15.680
You see.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.500
He puts the dough in line.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.710
Next.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.800
He is going to use the steel bar finally.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:43.890
Mao,

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.050
we have no time to appreciate it.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.550
It's useless.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:48.730
It's always the case.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.190
He puts it on the doughs.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.170
He's spinning!

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:35.920
The balls of dough

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:40.460
are rolled well.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.860
What do you think of it?

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:07.820
Although every movement

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.890
looks wild at first sight.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.410
But they're also bold and sophisticated.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.500
The wrappers look delicate as well.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.550
You really are Chef Ruoh.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.090
Exactly.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.980
They are all the same size.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.770
And they are of the perfect thickness

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.710
to make shumai.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.000
He's awesome.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.890
Do you have any time to admire him, Mao?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.860
He can make the wrappers

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:33.560
just by repeating such movements several times.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:35.330
It won't take him long.

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:37.340
What should we do?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.200
How is it?

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:40.780
Kid, what will you do?

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:42.400
All right.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:44.750
Actually I'll also make it in the way of spinning.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:46.460
Spinning?

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:47.450
It can't be.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.370
Well, let me get a steel bar here.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.550
Do you want to follow him?

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.530
I can't do it.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.750
But aren't you going to spin?

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.770
What I'll spin

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.510
is the dough.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.680
You mean spin the wrapper?

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.240
It becomes larger and larger.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.210
Silang, clear the countertop.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:37.010
Yes.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:40.100
Great.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.900
He should make use of centrifugal force.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:03.960
Wonderful!

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.030
It's so thin.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.080
How beautiful it is!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.950
OK, let's continue.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.540
That's it.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.120
The wrapper should be made so big

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.220
by centrifugal force.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.170
I haven't heard of any pastry cook

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.350
who can make wrappers in this way.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.240
Imagination not limited by tradition

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.350
is your secret weapon, isn't it?

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:24.350
He's different from

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.910
all cooks that I knew before.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.340
In southern China,

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:33.060
there should be such a shiny diamond.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:35.080
I'm totally convinced by him.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.200
But you won't

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.430
win

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:40.910
whatever shumai you make today.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.060
There's only one kind of

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.950
perfect shumai in the world.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.110
And I, Steel Bar Xie,

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.070
is the only one who knows it.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.120
It's really Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.530
I should find this here.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.450
This restaurant is growing on me.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.150
He takes away the Jinhua ham

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.420
which I bought just now.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.770
The Jinhua ham?

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.890
It's the best ham in China,

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.140
which is famous for the materials it uses.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:09.740
It's made from

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.600
the very precious Jinhua pigs.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.500
Why do you know it so clearly?

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:14.720
Come on,

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.560
I've been studying cuisine

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.820
for three years at least.

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.070
What is he doing?

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.390
There're two steel bares now.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.030
Mao, you're distracted again.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:36.950
I thought I've seen

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:38.270
all great cooks

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.790
during the trip of learning cuisine.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.110
But,

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.600
he's totally different.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:48.680
Steel Bar Xie

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.020
is the real King of Shooting Stars.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:51.840
It seems that

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:53.520
there will be a new star

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.020
marked on that steel bar.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.190
But you can't beat me so easily.

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.010
No, I will win.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:06.900
I will.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.070
He's so skillful

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:10.700
in dealing with meat.

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:11.720
Even so, I haven't ever seen someone

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:14.890
who can do it so neatly.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.770
He really deserves the honor of

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.510
Talented Dim Sum Master, Chef Xie.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.450
Mao, it's bad.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.470
He has minced the meat.

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:27.740
There's no time for you to see his show, Silang.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.550
You're the last person

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.100
to say this.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.590
Mao.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.580
Don't worry.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.140
Since you say so,

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.150
do you have any plan?

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.260
Yes.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.300
I’ve found the solution.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.460
Solution?

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.790
He's also a talented cook.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.810
He's not average.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:53.150
I wonder what Mao will choose.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.710
Apart from the meat,

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:55.680
the first is shrimp.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:57.940
You're right.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:00.000
Then, eggs

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.500
and vegetables.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.300
Great. You're right again.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:07.980
But the question is

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.830
what kind of shumai will he make.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.060
Well, the meat is done.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.620
That's terrific!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:19.980
Next...

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.220
It's a competition in shumai

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.760
between Mao from Yang Spring Restaurant

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.480
and Steel Bar Xie.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.780
I wonder what kind of shumai they will make.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:41.290
One hour left.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.810
Chef Ruoh, I’m done.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:44.950
No.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:49.000
He should make shumai for fifty people

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.490
just in an hour.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:51.780
So fast.

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:56.910
It's just for fifty people.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:20:59.300
Open it.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.460
I won't be scared

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.780
whatever happens.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:13.970
Please see

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.790
and have a taste.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:18.860
It's the perfect shumai.

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:33.170
It should be...

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:34.880
This is...

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:55.020
(To be continued)

00:23:15.059 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:21.733
Oh my god! Is this the shumai from Pastry Chef Xie Lu?

00:23:21.899 --> 00:23:23.735
This shumai is too good to be true.

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:27.405
Moreover, this made my secret plan useless.

00:23:27.489 --> 00:23:29.450
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.532 --> 00:23:31.993
Shine! Big Bang Shumai

00:23:32.118 --> 00:23:33.703
It will definitely be interesting!
